#: src/pages/[lang]/index.astro
msgid ""
"RUR Robotics is the robotics club of the School of Electrical Engineering "
"at the University of Belgrade. We build autonomous robots and compete in "
"Eurobot."
msgstr ""
"RUR Robotika je klub robotike Elektrotehničkog fakulteta Univerziteta u "
"Beogradu. Gradimo autonomne robote i takmičimo se na Eurobotu."

#: src/pages/[lang]/gallery/index.astro
