"Apply to join RUR Robotics, the robotics club of the School of Electrical "
"Engineering at the University of Belgrade."
msgstr ""
"Prijavi se za članstvo u RUR Robotici, klubu robotike Elektrotehničkog "
"fakulteta Univerziteta u Beogradu."

#: src/pages/[lang]/join/index.astro
msgid "What happens next"
msgstr "Šta sledi"

#: src/components/ui/JoinForm.astro
msgid "Thanks! We got your application and will be in touch soon."
msgstr "Hvala! Primili smo tvoju prijavu i uskoro ćemo ti se javiti."

#: src/components/ui/JoinForm.astro
msgid "Something went wrong. Check your answers and try again."
msgstr "Nešto je pošlo po zlu. Proveri odgovore i pokušaj ponovo."

#: src/pages/[lang]/join/index.astro
msgid "Fill in the form."
msgstr "Popuni formular."

#: src/pages/[lang]/join/index.astro
msgid "We email you when the selection round starts."
msgstr "Mejlom ti javljamo kada počinje krug selekcije."

#: src/pages/[lang]/join/index.astro
msgid "Pass the round and pick a project."
msgstr "Prođi krug i izaberi projekat."

#: src/components/ui/JoinForm.astro
msgid "Enter your name."
msgstr "Unesi svoje ime."

#: src/components/ui/JoinForm.astro
msgid "Enter a valid email."
msgstr "Unesi ispravan imejl."

#: src/components/ui/JoinForm.astro
msgid "Enter a valid phone number."
msgstr "Unesi ispravan broj telefona."

#: src/components/ui/JoinForm.astro
msgid "Enter your faculty."
msgstr "Unesi svoj fakultet."

#: src/components/ui/JoinForm.astro
msgid "Enter a year from 1 to 6."
msgstr "Unesi godinu od 1 do 6."

#: src/components/ui/JoinForm.astro
msgid "We couldn't confirm you're human. Complete the check and try again."
msgstr "Nismo uspeli da potvrdimo da si čovek. Završi proveru i pokušaj ponovo."

